Dear Imogen,

Further to our review of analytics suppliers, I am writing to give formal not=
ice under clause 3.2 of the Master Services Agreement dated 1 July 2022 (as r=
enewed on 1 July 2024) that Northgate Retail plc will not renew the agreement=
 on its expiry on 30 June 2025.

The decision reflects our programme to consolidate reporting and analytics in=
to our ERP vendor's module from July 2025. It is not a reflection on the Brig=
htwater service, which has performed well.

We would be open to a short transition arrangement on a reduced fee, covering=
 historical data access and export support, through to December 2025. Please =
let me know if you would like to discuss.

Kind regards,
Gareth Whitcombe
Head of Procurement, Northgate Retail plc

