<p>Dear Imogen,</p>
<p>Further to our review of analytics suppliers, I am writing to give formal =
notice under clause 3.2 of the Master Services Agreement dated 1 July 2022 (a=
s renewed on 1 July 2024) that <b>Northgate Retail plc will not renew the agr=
eement</b> on its expiry on <b>30 June 2025</b>.</p>
<p>The decision reflects our programme to consolidate reporting and analytics=
 into our ERP vendor's module from July 2025. It is not a reflection on the B=
rightwater service, which has performed well.</p>
<p>We would be open to a short transition arrangement on a reduced fee, cover=
ing historical data access and export support, through to <b>December 2025</b=
>. Please let me know if you would like to discuss.</p>
<p>Kind regards,<br>Gareth Whitcombe<br>Head of Procurement, Northgate Retail=
